cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use WordWise in research or publications, please cite this
  repository.
title: WordWise
abstract: >-
  A minimal vocabulary app for learning one word per day. No
  accounts, no tracking, no notifications — just a word, its
  definition, an example sentence, and audio pronunciation.
authors:
